  "name": "Chocolate Beetroot Cake with Mascarpone Frosting",
  "subtitle": "A moist cocoa cake finished with creamy mascarpone frosting",
  "description": "A rich chocolate cake made with grated beetroot, coconut, and coffee, topped with mascarpone frosting and grated dark chocolate.",
